# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# What this file keeps out of a PUBLIC repository, and why.
# Three of these four groups are not mine to publish.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 1. Third-party research corpora. All four carry licences that restrict
#    redistribution, and MPIIGaze requires registering with MPI directly.
#    They are cited in the paper; anyone reproducing the work obtains them
#    from the original providers.
300W_LP_DATASET/
AFLW2000_DATASET/
MPIIGaze_DATASET/
mrlEyes_2018_01_DATASET/
speech.zip
data/

# 2. Someone else's copyrighted papers, kept locally as writing references.
EEG PAPER(OVERALL).pdf
RISK ADJ(MATHEMATICAL EQUATIONS).pdf
ECHO(ALGORITHMS).pdf
els-cas-templates.zip

# 3. My own employment and academic records. Personal data, not research.
Casual Academic Timesheet*.docx
JD Academic Associate*.docx
Progression_Statement.htm
HandsFree_Project_Work.docx
UK Research Funding Opportunities - HandsFree.docx

# 4. Pre-trained models downloaded at setup time (801 MB). Redistributable,
#    but fetched by the setup instructions rather than committed.
models/faster-whisper-base.en/
models/vosk-model-small-en-us-0.15/
models/pretrained/
models/*.tflite
models/*.task

# Superseded drafts and build intermediates of the manuscript.
reports/*.zip
reports/*.docx
reports/overleaf/
HANDSFREE AI PAPER 1.docx
HANDSFREE AI PAPER 1.pdf
HANDSFREE_RESULT_Q1_F.docx
HandsFree_Results.docx
paper1.zip
paper1_edited.zip
paper1_fixed.zip
paper1_clean.zip
paper1_orig/

# Local calibration captures: gaze and face measurements of a real person.
calibration/

# Ordinary build and environment noise.
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
logs/
*.log
.claude/
Screenshot*.png
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Dated training snapshots and smoke-test artefacts: development clutter.
# _aug80k_* is kept, because Section 5.2 of the paper reports that experiment.
models/custom/_backup_*/
models/custom/_smoke/

# Generator for a personal funding brief: career material, not research.
scripts/build_funding_docx.py
